    "Stop looping replies": "停止循环的回复",
    "Short Claude system prompt": "精简 Claude 系统提示词",
    "A Claude subscription answers with the agent's own instructions as its system prompt, in place of Claude Code's, about 1K fewer tokens each request. Still the real Claude Code, but its requests look less like Claude Code's own, which can put the account more at risk": "Claude 订阅以智能体自己的指令作为系统提示词，代替 Claude Code 的，每次请求约少 1K token。仍是真正的 Claude Code，但请求不再那么像 Claude Code 自己发出的，账号风险可能更高",
    "Ask again after a refusal": "被拒答后再问",
    "When a vendor's safety filter refuses a request before anything is said, how many more accounts or routing group members are asked. Never ask again hands the refusal straight back: Claude Code then switches to its own fallback model, as it does on Anthropic's API": "供应商的安全过滤在还没说出任何内容前拒绝请求时，再换多少个账号或路由组成员去问。选“不再问”会直接把拒答交回：Claude Code 随后会像直连 Anthropic API 时一样，自己换到它的备用模型",
    "Never ask again": "不再问",
    "Disabled models": "已停用的模型",
    "Disable a model": "停用模型",
    "A disabled model is refused on every route through magpie (a request, a session, a routing group, a fallback, a sub-agent, a decision model) and left out of magpie's lists and agents' pickers. Only requests through magpie are covered. Type a pattern such as *fable* to disable every model it matches": "停用的模型在经过 magpie 的每条路径上都会被拒绝（直接请求、会话、路由组、回退、子 Agent、决策模型），也不会出现在 magpie 的列表和 Agent 的模型选择里。只管经过 magpie 的请求。输入 *fable* 这样的通配符可停用它匹配的所有模型",
    "Disable…": "停用…",
    "Matches {n}: {list}": "匹配 {n} 个：{list}",
    "Matches no model now; it is refused if one appears": "目前没有匹配的模型；出现时也会被拒绝",
    "Enable {model}": "启用 {model}",
    "A reply whose reasoning or text goes round the same few lines is ended with an error the agent can retry, not left to run to its output limit": "回复的思考或正文反复绕着同样几句打转时，就结束它并给 Agent 一个可以重试的错误，而不是一直跑到输出上限",
    "A reply's model says magpie's provider/model that answered (workbuddy/glm-5.3-flash), not the vendor's own name, for agents that count usage by it. Claude Code, Claude Desktop and Codex keep the vendor's; the X-Magpie-Model header says it to every agent": "回复的 model 写 magpie 里作答的 provider/model（workbuddy/glm-5.3-flash），而不是厂商自己的名字，给按它统计用量的 agent 用。Claude Code、Claude Desktop 和 Codex 仍拿到厂商的名字；X-Magpie-Model 响应头对所有 agent 都会写明",
    "Discard unsaved changes? Your changes will be lost.": "是否放弃未保存的修改？放弃后，这些修改将丢失。",
    "This removes the selected item. Continue?": "这将移除所选项目。是否继续？",
    "Its saved configuration will be removed. Agents using it may switch to another provider or their default model.": "这将删除它的已保存配置。使用它的 Agent 可能切换到其他供应商或默认模型。",
    "This account or key will stop being used for requests. You will need to add it again to use it.": "此账户或密钥将不再用于请求。要再次使用，需要重新添加。",
