    "Count cache reads too": "缓存读取也计入",
    "Tokens are each call's uncached input, output and cache writes. The cost is an estimate at the Usage page's prices, not a bill. Windows are calendar ones in this computer's time (a week from Monday), or every N days or N hours from when the limit is set or reset. Requests from this computer without a key aren't limited.": "Token 计未命中缓存的输入、输出和缓存写入。费用按用量页价格估算，非账单。周期按本机时间的自然日、周、月（每周从周一起），或从设置或重置额度时起每 N 天或每 N 小时。本机无密钥的请求不受限额。",
