    "Only each model's largest window": "只显示每个模型的最大上下文",
    "A model of 1M or more is listed once, as its 1M entry. Quit and reopen Claude Desktop after a change.": "上下文达到 1M 或以上的模型只列一项，即它的 1M 版本。改动后需退出并重新打开 Claude Desktop。",
