    "Switch an agent on and the models you set up in magpie show up as the {magpie} provider in its own model list; or pick its model right here.": "打开「接入」后，magpie 中配置的模型会作为 {magpie} 供应商出现在 agent 的模型列表里；也可在此直接选模型。",
