    "Switch an agent on and your models show up as the magpie provider in its own model list, to change in the agent. Or pick a model right here: the agent is connected and starts on it. Switch it off and it goes back to how it was.": "打开 agent 的「接入」，你的模型会作为 magpie 供应商出现在它的模型列表里，可在 agent 中切换。也可在此直接选模型：agent 自动接入并以它启动。关闭开关即恢复原状。",
