    "restore the previous {field} selection": "还原原来的 {field} 选择",
    "Restores {agent}'s previous {field} selection. Magpie's provider and private credential are removed when neither executor nor planner uses them.": "还原 {agent} 原来的 {field} 选择。执行模型和规划模型都不再使用 magpie 时，移除它的服务商配置和专用密钥。",
    "Default is {agent} as installed: magpie's endpoint and models come out, and {agent} starts on its own default model. What it had before magpie isn't put back; Disconnect and restore does that.": "「默认」即 {agent} 的初始设置：移除 magpie 的地址和模型，{agent} 以自身默认模型启动。不还原接入前的设置，还原请用「断开并还原」。",
    "{model} is {agent}'s own model: {agent} asks {vendor} for it itself, with its own sign-in, not through magpie. Picking it takes {agent} off magpie, and it starts on {model}.": "{model} 是 {agent} 自带的模型：{agent} 用自己的登录直接向 {vendor} 请求，不经过 magpie。选择后 {agent} 断开 magpie，以 {model} 启动。",
    "「接入」 goes off, and {agent} is listed under Not set up with the agents not connected. Switch it on again to go back through magpie.": "「接入」将关闭，{agent} 列入「未设置」。再次打开「接入」即可重新经过 magpie。",
    "「接入」 goes off. Switch it on again to go back through magpie.": "「接入」将关闭，再次打开即可重新经过 magpie。",
