    "Updates with {cmd}, as administrator: Windows asks first": "通过 {cmd} 以管理员身份更新：Windows 会先询问",
    "{agent} is installed in {prefix}, which only an administrator can change, and the administrator prompt was declined.": "{agent} 安装在 {prefix}，这个目录只有管理员能修改，而管理员授权提示被拒绝了。",
    "{agent} is installed in {prefix}, which only an administrator can change, and magpie couldn't ask Windows for one ({why}).": "{agent} 安装在 {prefix}，这个目录只有管理员能修改，而 magpie 没能向 Windows 请求管理员权限（{why}）。",
    "Update again and allow it, run {cmd} in a terminal opened as administrator, or move npm's global folder to one of your own (npm config set prefix \"%APPDATA%\\npm\") and install {agent} again.": "请再次更新并允许授权，或在以管理员身份打开的终端里运行 {cmd}，或把 npm 的全局目录改到自己的文件夹（npm config set prefix \"%APPDATA%\\npm\"）后重新安装 {agent}。",
    "npm installs into {prefix} here, which only an administrator can change: run the npm commands in a terminal opened as administrator, or first move npm's global folder to one of your own (npm config set prefix \"%APPDATA%\\npm\").": "这里 npm 会安装到 {prefix}，这个目录只有管理员能修改：请在以管理员身份打开的终端里运行 npm 命令，或先把 npm 的全局目录改到自己的文件夹（npm config set prefix \"%APPDATA%\\npm\"）。",
