    "magpie found {agent} {v} at {path}. That folder is one magpie looks in, but your terminal's PATH doesn't have it, so a terminal won't find {agent} there. If it was left behind by an uninstall, delete it.": "magpie 在 {path} 找到了 {agent} {v}。这个文件夹 magpie 会去找，但终端的 PATH 里没有它，所以终端里找不到这个 {agent}。如果它是卸载时没删干净留下的，把它删掉即可。",
    "{agent}'s settings are still here ({path}), but its command-line program isn't found: it may have been uninstalled. Install another agent, below the list, has its install command.": "{agent} 的配置还在（{path}），但找不到它的命令行程序，可能已被卸载。列表下方的「安装其他 Agent」里有它的安装命令。",
    "{agent}'s settings are still here ({path}), but its command-line program isn't found: it may have been uninstalled. Its settings are offered here again once it is installed.": "{agent} 的配置还在（{path}），但找不到它的命令行程序，可能已被卸载。重新安装后，这里会再显示它的设置。",
    "{agent}'s settings are still here, but its command-line program isn't found": "{agent} 的配置还在，但找不到它的命令行程序",
    "Run a command in a terminal, then come back: magpie lists the agent here once it is installed. The npm commands need Node.js (nodejs.org).": "在终端运行任一命令，安装后会列在这里。npm 命令需要 Node.js（nodejs.org）。",
    "Run a command in a terminal, then come back: magpie lists the agent here once it is installed.": "在终端运行任一命令，安装后会列在这里。",
    "No Node.js was found here, so the npm commands install it with nvm first.": "本机未找到 Node.js，npm 命令会先用 nvm 安装它。",
    "On a Mac, nvm needs Xcode's Command Line Tools: if it asks for them, run xcode-select --install, then the command again.": "Mac 上 nvm 需要 Xcode 命令行工具：如有提示，先运行 xcode-select --install，再重新运行命令。",
    "No Node.js was found here, so the npm commands install it with winget first; run them in PowerShell. If npm isn't found after Node.js is installed, open a new terminal and run the npm install again.": "本机未找到 Node.js，npm 命令会先用 winget 安装它，请在 PowerShell 中运行。若装好 Node.js 后仍找不到 npm，请打开新终端重新运行 npm 安装。",
