    "magpie's models join Codex's own; Codex stays signed in to ChatGPT, and while the Codex app blocks its account (out of allowance, no credits left) magpie is Codex's provider, so the app still sends": "默认。Codex 保持 ChatGPT 登录，magpie 的模型与 Codex 自带模型并列；当 Codex 应用拦下该账号（额度用尽且没有剩余积分）时，magpie 临时作为 Codex 的供应商，让 Codex 应用仍能发送",
    "Always ChatGPT": "始终 ChatGPT",
    "as ChatGPT, and kept so while the Codex app blocks its account: magpie never becomes Codex's provider. The Codex app may then send nothing till the account has room; Codex CLI goes on through magpie": "同 ChatGPT，且 Codex 应用拦下该账号时也不切换：magpie 不会成为 Codex 的供应商。此时 Codex 应用可能无法发送，直到账号恢复额度；Codex CLI 仍通过 magpie 继续",
    "magpie is Codex's provider; the Codex app is in its API state, with magpie's models only. Codex's Chrome control needs the ChatGPT sign-in, so pick ChatGPT to keep it": "magpie 作为 Codex 的供应商，Codex 应用显示为 API 登录状态，只列出 magpie 的模型。Codex 的 Chrome 控制需要 ChatGPT 登录，要保留它请选 ChatGPT",
    "magpie's key": "magpie 的密钥",
    "Claude Code sends magpie its key and is signed out of claude.ai while it runs through magpie: claude.ai's plan limits in /usage, its connectors, voice and /teleport are off": "Claude Code 向 magpie 发送 magpie 的密钥，经 magpie 运行期间处于 claude.ai 未登录状态：/usage 里的套餐限额、claude.ai 连接器、语音和 /teleport 都不可用",
    "Claude Code keeps its claude.ai sign-in (/login), so those work; it sends that sign-in to magpie, which never passes it on. Remote Control and ultrareview stay off: Claude Code has them only on Anthropic's own address": "Claude Code 保留 claude.ai 登录（/login），上述功能可用；它把这份登录凭据发给 magpie，magpie 不会转交给任何地方。Remote Control 和 ultrareview 仍不可用：Claude Code 只在 Anthropic 官方地址上提供它们",
