    "Names each thread in a hidden request of its own; at Codex’s own, it goes as Codex sends it, through its ChatGPT sign-in": "为每个会话起标题，是 Codex 单独发出的隐藏请求；选 Codex 自带时按 Codex 原样发送，经它的 ChatGPT 登录",
    "Writes each thread’s short description in a hidden request of its own; at Codex’s own, it goes as Codex sends it, through its ChatGPT sign-in": "为每个会话写简短描述，是 Codex 单独发出的隐藏请求；选 Codex 自带时按 Codex 原样发送，经它的 ChatGPT 登录",
    "Guesses your next message for the composer, reading the whole conversation again each time; at Codex’s own, it goes on the thread’s model through its ChatGPT sign-in": "为输入框猜测你的下一条消息，每次都把整段对话重读一遍；选 Codex 自带时用该会话的模型，经它的 ChatGPT 登录",
    "Decides an approval in your place when Codex’s approvals are on auto-review; Codex’s own pick is codex-auto-review, else the conversation’s model at low effort": "Codex 的审批设为自动审批时，代你决定是否批准；由 Codex 决定时用 codex-auto-review，没有则用当前对话的模型（低推理）",
