    "{model}, picked here, isn't set up any more: its provider was removed or turned off, or no longer has it. No other model sees, so images are turned away. Pick another model here.": "这里选的 {model} 已不可用：它的服务商被删除或关闭了，或者不再提供这个模型。也没有其他能看图的模型，所以图片会被拒收。请在这里另选一个模型。",
    "{model}, picked here, isn't set up any more: its provider was removed or turned off, or no longer has it. {auto}, the automatic choice, draws in its place. Pick another model here.": "这里选的 {model} 已不可用：它的服务商被删除或关闭了，或者不再提供这个模型。现在由自动选择的 {auto} 代为生成图片。请在这里另选一个模型。",
    "{model}, picked here, isn't set up any more: its provider was removed or turned off, or no longer has it. No other model draws, so a request that names no model is turned away. Pick another model here.": "这里选的 {model} 已不可用：它的服务商被删除或关闭了，或者不再提供这个模型。也没有其他能生图的模型，所以没指定模型的请求会被拒绝。请在这里另选一个模型。",
