    "Web search": "联网搜索",
    "Search APIs": "搜索 API",
    "Search API": "搜索 API",
    "When a model can't search the web, magpie searches for it with these, in this order, and gives it what they found": "模型不能联网搜索时，按顺序用这些 API 代为搜索并返回结果",
    "Now done by {who}; these come after it": "目前由 {who} 代搜，这些排在它之后",
    "Asked before {who}, which searches when these fail": "先用这些搜索，都失败时再由 {who} 代搜",
    "Search first with": "优先使用",
    "MCP server": "MCP 服务器",
    "Cursor, Claude Desktop and other agents can add this search as an MCP server (Streamable HTTP), with a web_search tool and a web_fetch tool that reads a page by its URL. From another computer, send a gateway key as Authorization: Bearer <key>.": "Cursor、Claude Desktop 等智能体可以把这个搜索添加为 MCP 服务器（Streamable HTTP），提供 web_search 工具和按 URL 读取网页的 web_fetch 工具。从其他电脑访问时，请以 Authorization: Bearer <key> 发送网关密钥。",
    "Ask {name}": "启用 {name}",
    "Off: kept with its key, and never asked": "关闭：保留它和它的密钥，但不再调用",
    "On: asked in its turn": "开启：按顺序轮到时调用",
    "Image recognition MCP server": "识图 MCP 服务器",
    "Agents can add image recognition as an MCP server (Streamable HTTP) with one analyze_image tool, which reads an image with the Image recognition model from a file path, a URL or a data URL. From another computer, send a gateway key as Authorization: Bearer <key> and the image as a URL or data URL.": "智能体可以把识图添加为 MCP 服务器（Streamable HTTP），提供一个 analyze_image 工具：用识图模型读取文件路径、URL 或 data URL 中的图片。从其他电脑访问时，请以 Authorization: Bearer <key> 发送网关密钥，图片以 URL 或 data URL 传入。",
    "The other is asked when it fails": "失败时再用另一种",
    "Model search": "模型代搜",
    "No provider can search, so these are asked": "没有能搜索的供应商，由这些 API 来搜",
    "When provider search is off, only configured Search APIs are used. Without a Search API, magpie does not add a search tool. Providers' native web search is unchanged.": "关闭供应商代搜后，仅使用已配置的搜索 API；未配置时，Magpie 不添加搜索工具。供应商自带的联网搜索不受影响。",
    "Provider search is off; only these APIs are used": "已关闭供应商代搜，仅使用这些 API",
    "Searches for other models": "代搜供应商",
    "When a model can't search the web directly, the selected provider searches for it and returns the results. Searches may use the service's quota or incur charges; if the provider magpie picks fails, it tries other available sources, but a provider you select here is never replaced by another provider, only by your Search APIs.": "当模型无法直接联网搜索时，由所选供应商代为搜索并返回结果。代搜可能消耗所用服务的额度或产生费用；magpie 自动选择的供应商失败时会尝试其他可用来源，但在此手动选中的供应商不会被换成其他供应商，只会改用你配置的搜索 API。",
    "{who} didn't search {when}: {why}. No other provider searched in its place; pick Automatic or another provider, or add a Search API.": "{who} {when}没能搜索：{why}。没有换用其他供应商代搜；可改选“自动”或其他供应商，或添加搜索 API。",
    "it answered without searching the web, so its account or plan may not offer web search": "它没有联网搜索就直接回答了，它的账号或套餐可能不支持联网搜索",
