    // providers
    "Qoder has no public API for this; magpie signs requests as its desktop client would, which Qoder may treat as third-party use and act on. Use an account you can afford to lose.": "Qoder 没有公开 API；magpie 以其桌面客户端的方式签发请求，Qoder 可能视为第三方使用并采取措施。请用丢了也不心疼的账号。",
    "Zed serves these models to its own editor; magpie signs requests as the editor would, which Zed may treat as third-party use and act on. Use an account you can afford to lose.": "Zed 只向自己的编辑器提供这些模型；magpie 以编辑器的方式签发请求，Zed 可能视为第三方使用并采取措施。请用丢了也不心疼的账号。",
    "Anthropic may suspend or ban a Claude account it sees used outside its own apps. magpie sends requests through Claude Code, but Anthropic may still act on them; you use it at your own risk. Use an account you can afford to lose.": "Anthropic 可能封禁在其官方应用之外使用的 Claude 账号。magpie 的请求经 Claude Code 发出，但 Anthropic 仍可能采取措施，风险自负。请用丢了也不心疼的账号。",
    "Factory serves these models to its own Droid CLI; magpie signs requests as Droid would, which Factory may treat as third-party use and act on. Use an account you can afford to lose.": "Factory 只向自己的 Droid CLI 提供这些模型；magpie 以 Droid 的方式签发请求，Factory 可能视为第三方使用并采取措施。请用丢了也不心疼的账号。",
    "A Go plan account is used through Command Code's private interface, which Command Code may treat as a breach of its terms and ban the account for. Pro, Max and the other plans use its Provider API. Use a Go account you can afford to lose.": "Go 套餐账号经 Command Code 的私有接口使用，Command Code 可能视为违反条款并封禁该账号。Pro、Max 等其他套餐走其 Provider API。请用丢了也不心疼的 Go 账号。",
    "Xiaomi serves these models to its own MiMo app; magpie signs requests as the app would, which Xiaomi may treat as third-party use and act on. Use an account you can afford to lose.": "小米只向自己的 MiMo 应用提供这些模型；magpie 以该应用的方式签发请求，小米可能视为第三方使用并采取措施。请用丢了也不心疼的账号。",
