    "The most a reply may hold, told to the agents as their max tokens and sent as max_tokens on Anthropic's API when the agent names none; empty leaves it to the vendor and models.dev": "单次回复的最大 token 数，作为 max tokens 告知 Agent，Agent 没给时也作为 max_tokens 发给 Anthropic 的 API；留空则按厂商和 models.dev",
