    "magpie's models are in VS Code's Chat model picker, under magpie (VS Code 1.122 or later). If they don't show, run Developer: Reload Window in VS Code.": "magpie 的模型位于 VS Code 聊天模型选择器的 magpie 分组下（需 VS Code 1.122 或更高）。若未出现，请在 VS Code 中运行 Developer: Reload Window。",
