    "The library checks skills for updates with it: GitHub allows 5,000 requests an hour with a token, 60 without. It also installs skills from private repositories it can read; for public ones it needs no scopes.": "资源库检查技能更新时使用。GitHub 每小时允许带令牌 5000 次请求，不带仅 60 次。也用它从它能读取的私有仓库安装技能；公开仓库无需勾选权限。",
    "Using {env} from the environment ({mask}); a token set here comes first.": "正在使用环境变量 {env}（{mask}）；在这里设置的令牌优先。",
    "a GitHub token is one word, without spaces": "GitHub 令牌是一串不含空格的字符",
