    "Connecting to it to list its tools": "正在连接并列出它的工具",
    "Click to check again": "点击重新检查",
    "not checked": "未检查",
    "No agent has it, so it isn't checked on its own": "没有 agent 在用它，所以不会自动检查",
    "No agent shown here has it on, so it isn't checked on its own": "这里显示的 agent 都没有开着它，所以不会自动检查",
    "Click to check it": "点击检查",
    "Click to see them": "点击查看工具",
    "Click to hide them": "点击收起",
    "Sign-in ran out": "登录已失效",
    "Sign in again": "重新登录",
    "OAuth app": "OAuth 应用",
    "the server's sign-in doesn't let an app register itself (no dynamic client registration), so magpie signs in to it only as an OAuth app of your own: make one with the server's vendor (GitHub's under Settings › Developer settings › OAuth Apps), with http://localhost/callback as its callback URL, then give its client ID and secret under \"OAuth app\" in the server's editor": "该服务器的登录不允许应用自行注册（不支持动态客户端注册），因此 magpie 只能以你自己的 OAuth 应用登录：在服务方创建一个（GitHub 的在 Settings › Developer settings › OAuth Apps），回调 URL 填 http://localhost/callback，再在该服务器编辑器的「OAuth 应用」中填入它的客户端 ID 和密钥",
    "Sign-in required": "需要重新登录",
    "GitHub refused this Copilot sign-in; sign in again": "GitHub 拒绝了这个 Copilot 登录，请重新登录",
    "The vendor revoked this sign-in; sign in again": "服务商已撤销这个登录，请重新登录",
    "sign-in required": "需要重新登录",
    "Sign in again to use this account": "重新登录后才能使用此账号",
    "Claude Code is no longer signed in; sign in again in magpie": "Claude Code 已退出登录，请在 magpie 中重新登录",
