    // gateway
    "running": "运行中",
    "running · served by another magpie": "运行中 · 由另一个 magpie 提供",
    "running · served by magpie {v}, older than this one": "运行中 · 由更旧的 magpie {v} 提供",
    "Agents' requests go through magpie {v} and are sent as it sends them, without this version's fixes. Quit it here and this one serves the gateway at once.": "Agent 的请求经 magpie {v} 发出，不含当前版本的修复。在这里关闭它，当前版本会立即接管网关。",
