    "Restarting the gateway…": "正在重启网关…",
    "Starting the gateway…": "正在启动网关…",
    "Port {port} is held by {path} (pid {pid}), which isn't magpie, so magpie leaves it alone. Quit it yourself, or move the gateway to another port in Settings.": "端口 {port} 被 {path}（pid {pid}）占用，它不是 magpie，所以 magpie 不会动它。请自行退出它，或在设置里把网关换到其他端口。",
    "Port {port} is forwarded by {path} (pid {pid}) to a container or a VM: the magpie {v} answering there runs inside it, out of this magpie's reach. Stop that container (docker ps lists it, docker stop <name> stops it, or stop it in OrbStack or Docker Desktop), or move this magpie's gateway to another port in Settings.": "端口 {port} 由 {path}（pid {pid}）转发到一个容器或虚拟机：在那里应答的 magpie {v} 运行在容器里，这个 magpie 管不到它。请停掉那个容器（docker ps 可以列出它，docker stop <名称> 停掉它，或在 OrbStack、Docker Desktop 里停止），或在设置里把这个 magpie 的网关换到其他端口。",
    "magpie can't see which process holds port {port}: it runs as another user or as administrator. Quit it there.": "magpie 看不到是哪个进程占用了端口 {port}：它以其他用户或管理员身份运行。请在那边退出它。",
    "magpie {v} (pid {pid}, {path}) runs as another user or as administrator, so this magpie can't quit it. Quit it there.": "magpie {v}（pid {pid}，{path}）以其他用户或管理员身份运行，当前 magpie 无法关闭它。请在那边退出它。",
    "magpie {v} (pid {pid}) didn't quit. End it in your system's process list (Activity Monitor, Task Manager).": "magpie {v}（pid {pid}）没有退出。请在系统的进程列表（活动监视器、任务管理器）里结束它。",
    "Something started magpie on port {port} again at once ({path}, pid {pid}): a login item or a service keeps it running (a LaunchAgent, a systemd unit, a scheduled task). Remove that, then try again.": "端口 {port} 上的 magpie 被立即重新启动了（{path}，pid {pid}）：有登录项或系统服务让它一直运行（LaunchAgent、systemd 单元、计划任务）。请先移除它，再重试。",
    "Port {port} is in use by {path} (pid {pid}): quit it, or move the gateway to another port in Settings.": "端口 {port} 被 {path}（pid {pid}）占用：请退出它，或在设置里把网关换到其他端口。",
    "Port {port} is in use by another program: quit it, or move the gateway to another port in Settings.": "端口 {port} 被其他程序占用：请退出它，或在设置里把网关换到其他端口。",
