    "The plan's 5-hour, weekly and monthly windows are told only to the account's access key (Volcengine console → API Access Keys), not to the plan's API key. Give it here for the Usage page to show them; it is used for nothing else.": "套餐的 5 小时、每周和每月额度只对账号的访问密钥开放（火山引擎控制台 → API 访问密钥），套餐的 API Key 查不到。填在这里，用量页就会显示它们；仅用于查询额度。",
    "SecretId": "SecretId",
    "SecretKey": "SecretKey",
    "Token Plan Enterprise's usage is told only to the Tencent Cloud account's API key (console → Access management → API keys), not to the plan's API key. Give its SecretId and SecretKey here for the Usage page to show it; a sub-user's key that may read TokenHub is enough. It is used for nothing else.": "Token Plan 企业版的用量只对腾讯云账号的 API 密钥开放（控制台 → 访问管理 → API 密钥管理），套餐的 API Key 查不到。在这里填入它的 SecretId 和 SecretKey，用量页就会显示；有 TokenHub 读权限的子用户密钥即可。仅用于查询用量。",
    "This plan's usage needs the account's AccessKey ID and Secret — give them in the provider's settings": "此套餐的用量需要账号的 AccessKey ID 和 Secret 才能读取，请在服务商设置里填写",
