    "The Balance URL …/api/usage/token takes the API key, not the access token — set it to …/api/user/self in the provider's settings": "余额查询地址 …/api/usage/token 只认 API Key，不认访问令牌，请在供应商设置里改为 …/api/user/self",
    "Add the header New-Api-User = your user ID (shown in the site's personal settings) to the provider's Headers": "请在供应商的「请求头」中添加 New-Api-User = 你的用户 ID（见站点个人设置）",
