    "The `magpie` command at {path} is a copied file, not the installer's link to the app: it won't follow the app's updates, and an old copy can break what a new one fixed. Re-run the installer, or link it by hand.": "`magpie` 命令（{path}）是拷贝的文件，不是安装脚本建立的应用链接：不会随应用更新，旧拷贝可能使新版的修复失效。请重新运行安装脚本，或手动建立链接。",
