    "{n} requests in this period were magpie's own": "此期间有 {n} 个请求是 magpie 自身发出的",
    "Requests magpie made by itself, not an agent: a routing group's classifier, a web search or an image description. They count against the key or account like any other request.": "magpie 自身发出的请求，而非智能体发出的：路由组的分类器、网页搜索或图片描述。它们与其他请求一样计入密钥或账号的用量。",
