    "At its cap": "已达上限",
    "At its cap · back {in}": "已达上限 · {in}恢复",
    "A usage window is at {n}%, past this account's {cap}% cap, so magpie counts it as used up and sends requests to the other accounts until that window renews": "某个用量窗口已用 {n}%，超过该账号的 {cap}% 上限，窗口重置前视为已用完，请求发给其他账号",
    "With no other account on, requests are refused with a usage-cap error until then": "没有其他启用的账号时，在此之前请求会返回“已达用量上限”的错误",
    "At its cap · {agent} still uses it": "已达上限 · {agent} 仍在使用",
    "A usage window is at {n}%, past this account's {cap}% cap: requests through magpie are refused with a usage-cap error until it renews": "某个用量窗口已用 {n}%，超过该账号的 {cap}% 上限：窗口重置前，经 magpie 的请求会返回“已达用量上限”错误",
    "{agent} is signed in to this account and asks its vendor itself, not through magpie, so with no other account on to move it to, {agent} goes on using it past the cap. Add another account, or pick {agent}'s models via magpie, for the cap to hold it": "{agent} 登录此账号并直接向厂商发请求，不经过 magpie；没有其他启用账号可切换时，{agent} 会超过上限继续使用。添加其他账号，或为 {agent} 选择经 magpie 的模型，上限才能生效",
    "{names} at its cap": "{names}已达上限",
    "{names} at its cap · back {in}": "{names}已达上限 · {in}恢复",
    "{names} is at {n}%, past this account's {cap}% cap, so magpie sends the requests it counts to the other accounts until it renews; other models still use this account": "{names}已用 {n}%，超过该账号的 {cap}% 上限，重置前计入它的请求发给其他账号；其他模型仍用此账号",
    "With no other account on, those requests are refused with a usage-cap error until then": "没有其他启用的账号时，在此之前这些请求会返回“已达用量上限”的错误",
    "Stops at {n}% of each usage window: once magpie reads a window at {n}% or past it, it counts this account as used up and sends it nothing more until the window renews. A turn already under way can still take it past {n}%, so the cap doesn't promise the rest is left. Click to change": "每个用量窗口用到 {n}% 即停：magpie 读到某个窗口达到 {n}% 或更高后，就把该账号视为已用完，在窗口重置前不再给它发请求。已在进行中的请求仍可能让它超过 {n}%，所以上限不保证剩下的额度不被用掉。点击修改",
    "Used to 100% of its usage windows. Click to cap it at a share of each, so magpie goes on to the other accounts past it": "用量窗口会用到 100%。点击设置比例上限，超过后改用其他账号",
    "{who} stops at {n}% of each window": "{who} 每个窗口用到 {n}% 即停",
    "No cap on {window}: it is used to 100%, whatever this account's cap. Click to change": "{window}不设上限：无论此账号的上限是多少，都用到 100%。点击修改",
    "{window} has a cap of its own: magpie counts this account as used up once {window} is at {n}%, until it renews. Click to change": "{window}有自己的上限：{window}用到 {n}% 时，magpie 就把此账号算作用完，直到它重置。点击修改",
    "Click to give {window} a cap of its own, apart from this account's": "点击为{window}单独设一个上限，与此账号的上限分开",
    "{window} of {who} follows the account's cap": "{who} 的{window}改为沿用账号上限",
    "{window} of {who} has no cap": "{who} 的{window}不设上限",
    "{who} stops at {n}% of {window}": "{who} 的{window}用到 {n}% 即停",
    "Cap for {window}, in percent": "{window}的上限，百分比",
