    "{agent} needs an administrator here, and the administrator prompt was declined.": "{agent} 在这里需要管理员权限，而管理员授权提示被拒绝了。",
    "{agent} needs an administrator here, and magpie couldn't ask Windows for one ({why}).": "{agent} 在这里需要管理员权限，而 magpie 没能向 Windows 请求管理员权限（{why}）。",
    "Try again and allow it, or run {cmd} in a terminal opened as administrator.": "请再试一次并允许授权，或在以管理员身份打开的终端里运行 {cmd}。",
