    "Install Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, OpenCode… and the library can give them the same instructions, MCP servers and skills.": "安装 Claude Code、Codex、Gemini CLI、OpenCode 等之后，资源库就能给它们同一份指令、MCP 服务器和技能。",
    "magpie keeps a copy of every file before it writes it.": "magpie 写入任何文件前都会先备份一份。",
