    "Drop the list fetched from the vendor; the models.dev one is used until models are fetched again": "丢弃从供应商获取的列表；在重新获取模型前使用 models.dev 的列表",
    "Only through routing groups": "只通过路由分组使用",
    "Searches the web by itself": "自己能联网搜索",
    "Both": "两者都发",
    "Key header": "密钥请求头",
    "Which header the API key goes in on the Anthropic API. Most services take both; pick one for a service that refuses the two together. magpie also switches to one by itself when a service says so.": "Anthropic API 的 API 密钥放在哪个请求头里。多数服务两个都接受；有的服务不允许两个同时出现，就选其中一个。服务这样提示时，magpie 也会自己改成只发一个。",
    "Redaction": "脱敏",
    "Send requests unmasked": "请求不脱敏",
    "Don't check its certificate": "不校验它的证书",
    "Certificate": "证书",
    "For your own server with a self-signed certificate or one from your company's CA. magpie then can't tell it from another machine answering at its address: turn it on only on a network you trust.": "用于你自己的服务器，证书是自签名的或来自公司内部 CA。开启后 magpie 无法分辨应答的是它本身还是同一地址上的另一台机器：只在你信任的网络中开启。",
    "Codex compacts on this provider": "Codex 在此服务商上原生压缩",
    "Codex's compaction is asked of this provider as Codex sent it, and the summary it seals goes back to Codex unchanged. Off, magpie writes the summary. A conversation compacted this way continues only on this provider and account: another is refused with an error, never sent without the context.": "Codex 的压缩请求原样交给此服务商，它加密的摘要原样还给 Codex。关闭时由 magpie 写摘要。这样压缩过的对话只能在此服务商和账号上继续：换到别处会报错说明，绝不丢掉上下文发出。",
    "For a model running on this computer or your local network: secrets, personal data and your masked words go to it as written. Leave it off for a local relay or proxy that passes requests on to a vendor.": "给运行在这台电脑或局域网里的模型：密钥、个人信息和你设的脱敏词按原样发给它。如果它是本地的中转或代理、会把请求转给供应商，请保持关闭。",
    "User-Agent": "User-Agent",
    "Send the agent's own User-Agent": "发送 Agent 自己的 User-Agent",
    "For a plan that serves only the coding agents it names: each request goes with the User-Agent the agent sent (pi, OpenCode, Claude Code…), not magpie's. Requests magpie makes itself, and ones the agent sent without one, still go as magpie. A User-Agent set in Headers above always wins.": "给只允许指定编程 Agent 使用的套餐：每个请求带上 Agent 自己发来的 User-Agent（pi、OpenCode、Claude Code…），而不是 magpie 的。magpie 自己发出的请求，以及 Agent 没带 User-Agent 的请求，仍以 magpie 的身份发送。上面请求头里设置的 User-Agent 始终优先。",
    "DeepSeek models only from DeepSeek's own API": "DeepSeek 模型只走 DeepSeek 官方上游",
    "Upstream": "上游",
    "Cline serves a model from any host its gateway picks; pinned, a request for a DeepSeek model goes only to DeepSeek, which keeps its prompt cache, and fails when DeepSeek can't take it": "Cline 的网关会把一个模型发给它挑的任意上游；钉住后，DeepSeek 模型的请求只发给 DeepSeek 官方，缓存能命中；DeepSeek 官方接不了时请求会失败，不会换别家",
    "For a relay in front of Anthropic's or OpenAI's own API: Claude Code's WebSearch and Codex's web_search go to it as they were sent, not through magpie's search. magpie doesn't automatically search with it for other models, but you can name it as the searcher.": "用于 Anthropic 或 OpenAI 官方 API 前的中转：Claude Code 的 WebSearch 和 Codex 的 web_search 原样发给它，不经 magpie 搜索。不会自动用它为其他模型搜索，但可手动选为代搜供应商。",
    "Its models leave the list agents pick from; the routing groups they are in still use them": "它的模型不出现在 Agent 的可选列表里；所在的路由分组仍会使用它们",
    "Agents don't see them: only the routing groups they are in use them.": "Agent 看不到这些模型，只有它们所在的路由分组会用到。",
    "Agents see the models picked.": "Agent 看到的是已勾选的模型。",
    "In no routing group, so no agent can use them now: {models}.": "不在任何路由分组中，暂无 Agent 能用：{models}。",
    "Once saved, make a group of them in Routing.": "保存后可在「路由」里为它们建分组。",
    "Make a routing group of {model}": "用 {model} 建路由分组",
    "Make a routing group of it": "用它建路由分组",
    "Pick {group}": "选 {group}",
    "{provider} is used only through routing groups: agents reach {model} by picking {group}.": "{provider} 设为只通过路由分组使用：选 {group} 即可用到 {model}。",
    "{provider} is used only through routing groups, and {model} is in none, so no agent can use it. Make a group of it, or untick “Only through routing groups” in {provider}'s models.": "{provider} 设为只通过路由分组使用，而 {model} 不在任何分组中，没有 Agent 能用它。可为它建分组，或在 {provider} 的模型中取消勾选「只通过路由分组使用」。",
    "None selected: no agent or routing group uses its models. Its balance and usage still show. Click a model to pick it.": "全不选：Agent 和路由分组都不使用它的模型，余额和用量照常显示。点击模型可勾选。",
    "Routing groups use it: none are picked, so the vendor's list is used": "路由分组会用到它：没有勾选任何模型时，用的是供应商的列表",
    "Click to pick just this model": "点击只选这个模型",
    "Agents see it: none are picked, so the vendor's list is used": "Agent 能看到它：没有勾选任何模型时，用的是供应商的列表",
    "Bring in": "导入",
