    "Short Claude system prompt": "精簡 Claude 系統提示詞",
    "A Claude subscription answers with the agent's own instructions as its system prompt, in place of Claude Code's, about 1K fewer tokens each request. Still the real Claude Code, but its requests look less like Claude Code's own, which can put the account more at risk": "Claude 訂閱以代理自己的指令作為系統提示詞，取代 Claude Code 的，每次請求約少 1K token。仍是真正的 Claude Code，但請求不再那麼像 Claude Code 自己發出的，帳號風險可能更高",
    "Ask again after a refusal": "被拒答後再問",
    "When a vendor's safety filter refuses a request before anything is said, how many more accounts or routing group members are asked. Never ask again hands the refusal straight back: Claude Code then switches to its own fallback model, as it does on Anthropic's API": "供應商的安全過濾在還沒說出任何內容前拒絕請求時，再換多少個帳號或路由組成員去問。選「不再問」會直接把拒答交回：Claude Code 隨後會像直連 Anthropic API 時一樣，自己換到它的備用模型",
    "Never ask again": "不再問",
    "Disabled models": "已停用的模型",
    "Disable a model": "停用模型",
    "A disabled model is refused on every route through magpie (a request, a session, a routing group, a fallback, a sub-agent, a decision model) and left out of magpie's lists and agents' pickers. Only requests through magpie are covered. Type a pattern such as *fable* to disable every model it matches": "停用的模型在經過 magpie 的每條路徑上都會被拒絕（直接請求、工作階段、路由群組、備援、子 Agent、決策模型），也不會出現在 magpie 的列表和 Agent 的模型選擇裡。只管經過 magpie 的請求。輸入 *fable* 這樣的萬用字元可停用它比對到的所有模型",
    "Disable…": "停用…",
    "Matches {n}: {list}": "比對到 {n} 個：{list}",
    "Matches no model now; it is refused if one appears": "目前沒有比對到的模型；出現時也會被拒絕",
    "Enable {model}": "啟用 {model}",
    "A reply whose reasoning or text goes round the same few lines is ended with an error the agent can retry, not left to run to its output limit": "回覆的思考或正文反覆繞著同樣幾句打轉時，就結束它並給 Agent 一個可以重試的錯誤，而不是一直跑到輸出上限",
    "A reply's model says magpie's provider/model that answered (workbuddy/glm-5.3-flash), not the vendor's own name, for agents that count usage by it. Claude Code, Claude Desktop and Codex keep the vendor's; the X-Magpie-Model header says it to every agent": "回覆的 model 寫 magpie 裡作答的 provider/model（workbuddy/glm-5.3-flash），而不是廠商自己的名字，給按它統計用量的 agent 用。Claude Code、Claude Desktop 和 Codex 仍拿到廠商的名字；X-Magpie-Model 回應頭對所有 agent 都會寫明",
    "Discard unsaved changes? Your changes will be lost.": "是否放棄未儲存的修改？放棄後，這些修改將丟失。",
    "This removes the selected item. Continue?": "這將移除所選專案。是否繼續？",
