    "Not connected · now on its Claude subscription": "未接入 · 現在用 Claude 訂閱",
    "Not connected · now signed in with ChatGPT · OpenAI's models stay available once connected": "未接入 · 現在用 ChatGPT 登入 · 接入後 OpenAI 的模型照常可用",
    "Not connected · goes through magpie only to fail over to your other ChatGPT accounts": "未接入 · 只為切換到你的其他 ChatGPT 帳號而經過 magpie",
    "magpie set openai_base_url in {agent}'s config.toml, so a request the ChatGPT account {agent} is signed in to has no allowance for goes on to your other ChatGPT accounts on in magpie. {agent} keeps to its own models. To stop it, tick Only switch {agent}'s sign-in under Providers › Codex, or switch those accounts off; connecting {agent} adds magpie's models.": "magpie 在 {agent} 的 config.toml 裡寫了 openai_base_url：{agent} 登入的 ChatGPT 帳號額度不夠時，請求會轉到你在 magpie 裡啟用的其他 ChatGPT 帳號。{agent} 只列出它自己的模型。要停止，請在 供應商 › Codex 裡勾選「只切換 {agent} 的登入」，或停用那些帳號；接入 {agent} 則會加上 magpie 的模型。",
