    "The {agent} app, started {when}: closing its window keeps it running. Quit it with {cmd} and open it again.": "{when}啟動的 {agent} 應用：關掉視窗它仍在執行。用 {cmd} 結束後再打開。",
    "{agent} in an editor (VS Code, Cursor…), started {when}: reload that editor's window.": "{when}啟動的編輯器（VS Code、Cursor…）裡的 {agent}：重新載入那個編輯器的視窗。",
