    "Switch an agent on and the models you set up in magpie show up as the {magpie} provider in its own model list; or pick its model right here.": "開啟「接入」後，magpie 中設定的模型會作為 {magpie} 供應商出現在 agent 的模型列表裡；也可在此直接選模型。",
