    "Connected · pick magpie's models with {cmd} in {agent}": "已接入 · 在 {agent} 裡用 {cmd} 選 magpie 的模型",
    "Connected · magpie's models are in {agent}'s model list": "已接入 · magpie 的模型在 {agent} 的模型列表裡",
    "Connect {agent} to magpie": "將 {agent} 接入 magpie",
    "Add a provider or subscription in magpie first, then connect {agent}": "請先在 magpie 中新增一個供應商或訂閱，再接入 {agent}",
    "A proxy in front of magpie stopped waiting; magpie may still be finishing, check again in a minute ({what})": "magpie 前面的代理等不及先回傳了；magpie 可能仍在處理，請過一分鐘再看看（{what}）",
    "A proxy in front of magpie answered, not magpie ({what})": "這是 magpie 前面的代理回傳的，不是 magpie 的回應（{what}）",
    "None of magpie's models is left in {agent}'s model list: pick one under Model list → Pick, then connect {agent}": "magpie 的模型都不在 {agent} 的模型列表裡：先在「模型列表 → 挑選」裡選一個，再接入 {agent}",
