    "Switch on and {agent}'s model list gets magpie's models": "開啟後，{agent} 的模型列表裡就有 magpie 的模型",
    "{agent} is connected to magpie": "{agent} 已接入 magpie",
    "{agent} is connected to magpie · back on {model}, what it was on when it was switched off": "{agent} 已接入 magpie · 回到上次斷開前用的 {model}",
