    "{agent} is connected to magpie · on {model} through magpie: it had no model set, so the first of its own": "{agent} 已接入 magpie · 原先未設模型，改用它自己列表中的第一個：{model}",
    "{agent} is connected to magpie · on {model} through magpie: magpie doesn't serve the model it was on": "{agent} 已接入 magpie · magpie 沒有它原來的模型，改用 {model}",
    "{agent} is connected to magpie · it stays on its own last pick; magpie's models join its {cmd}": "{agent} 已接入 magpie · 仍用它上次選的模型，magpie 的模型已加入 {cmd}",
    "via magpie": "經 magpie",
    "{agent} asks magpie for it": "{agent} 經 magpie 請求這個模型",
    "direct, not via magpie": "直連，不經 magpie",
    "off magpie": "不經 magpie",
    "{agent} as installed: magpie's endpoint and models come out": "{agent} 初始設定：移除 magpie 的位址和模型",
    "Take {agent} off magpie?": "讓 {agent} 不再經過 magpie？",
    "restore the previous {field} selection": "還原原來的 {field} 選擇",
    "Restores {agent}'s previous {field} selection. Magpie's provider and private credential are removed when neither executor nor planner uses them.": "還原 {agent} 原來的 {field} 選擇。執行模型和規劃模型都不再使用 magpie 時，移除它的服務商設定和專用金鑰。",
    "Default is {agent} as installed: magpie's endpoint and models come out, and {agent} starts on its own default model. What it had before magpie isn't put back; Disconnect and restore does that.": "「預設」即 {agent} 的初始設定：移除 magpie 的位址和模型，{agent} 以自身預設模型啟動。不還原接入前的設定，還原請用「斷開並還原」。",
    "{model} is {agent}'s own model: {agent} asks {vendor} for it itself, with its own sign-in, not through magpie. Picking it takes {agent} off magpie, and it starts on {model}.": "{model} 是 {agent} 自帶的模型：{agent} 用自己的登入直接向 {vendor} 請求，不經過 magpie。選擇後 {agent} 斷開 magpie，以 {model} 啟動。",
    "「接入」 goes off, and {agent} is listed under Not set up with the agents not connected. Switch it on again to go back through magpie.": "「接入」將關閉，{agent} 列入「未設定」。再次開啟「接入」即可重新經過 magpie。",
    "「接入」 goes off. Switch it on again to go back through magpie.": "「接入」將關閉，再次開啟即可重新經過 magpie。",
    "Use default": "使用預設",
    "Use {model}": "使用 {model}",
    "{agent} no longer goes through magpie · on its own default": "{agent} 已不經過 magpie · 使用自身預設設定",
    "{agent} no longer goes through magpie; its own settings are back": "{agent} 已不再經過 magpie，原來的設定已還原",
    "Update to {v}": "更新到 {v}",
    "Updates with {cmd}": "透過 {cmd} 更新",
    "Updates with {cmd}, as administrator: Windows asks first": "透過 {cmd} 以系統管理員身分更新：Windows 會先詢問",
    "{agent} is installed in {prefix}, which only an administrator can change, and the administrator prompt was declined.": "{agent} 安裝在 {prefix}，這個資料夾只有系統管理員能修改，而系統管理員授權提示被拒絕了。",
    "{agent} is installed in {prefix}, which only an administrator can change, and magpie couldn't ask Windows for one ({why}).": "{agent} 安裝在 {prefix}，這個資料夾只有系統管理員能修改，而 magpie 無法向 Windows 要求系統管理員權限（{why}）。",
    "Update again and allow it, run {cmd} in a terminal opened as administrator, or move npm's global folder to one of your own (npm config set prefix \"%APPDATA%\\npm\") and install {agent} again.": "請再次更新並允許授權，或在以系統管理員身分開啟的終端機中執行 {cmd}，或把 npm 的全域資料夾改到自己的資料夾（npm config set prefix \"%APPDATA%\\npm\"）後重新安裝 {agent}。",
    "npm installs into {prefix} here, which only an administrator can change: run the npm commands in a terminal opened as administrator, or first move npm's global folder to one of your own (npm config set prefix \"%APPDATA%\\npm\").": "這裡 npm 會安裝到 {prefix}，這個資料夾只有系統管理員能修改：請在以系統管理員身分開啟的終端機中執行 npm 指令，或先把 npm 的全域資料夾改到自己的資料夾（npm config set prefix \"%APPDATA%\\npm\"）。",
    "{agent} updated to {v}": "{agent} 已更新到 {v}",
    "{agent} is already being updated": "{agent} 正在更新",
    "{n} agents have updates: {names}": "{n} 個 Agent 有新版本：{names}",
    "Updating {agent}… ({i} of {n})": "正在更新 {agent}…（{i}/{n}）",
    "{agent} has an update": "{agent} 有新版本",
    "Every agent is up to date": "所有 Agent 都已是最新",
    "{ok} of {n} agents updated · {failed} didn't: {names}": "{n} 個 Agent 中已更新 {ok} 個 · {failed} 個未成功：{names}",
    "{agent} updated: {from} → {v}": "{agent} 已更新：{from} → {v}",
    "{n} agents updated: {list}": "已更新 {n} 個 Agent：{list}",
    "{ok} of {n} agents updated: {list} · {failed} didn't: {names}": "{n} 個 Agent 中已更新 {ok} 個：{list} · {failed} 個未成功：{names}",
    "Install another agent ({n})": "安裝其他 Agent（{n}）",
    "CLI not found": "未找到 CLI",
    "Not on your terminal's PATH": "不在終端機的 PATH 裡",
    "magpie found {agent} {v} at {path}. That folder is one magpie looks in, but your terminal's PATH doesn't have it, so a terminal won't find {agent} there. If it was left behind by an uninstall, delete it.": "magpie 在 {path} 找到了 {agent} {v}。這個資料夾 magpie 會去找，但終端機的 PATH 裡沒有它，所以終端機裡找不到這個 {agent}。如果它是解除安裝時沒刪乾淨留下的，把它刪掉即可。",
    "{agent}'s settings are still here ({path}), but its command-line program isn't found: it may have been uninstalled. Install another agent, below the list, has its install command.": "{agent} 的設定還在（{path}），但找不到它的命令列程式，可能已被解除安裝。列表下方的「安裝其他 Agent」裡有它的安裝命令。",
    "{agent}'s settings are still here ({path}), but its command-line program isn't found: it may have been uninstalled. Its settings are offered here again once it is installed.": "{agent} 的設定還在（{path}），但找不到它的命令列程式，可能已被解除安裝。重新安裝後，這裡會再顯示它的設定。",
    "{agent}'s settings are still here, but its command-line program isn't found": "{agent} 的設定還在，但找不到它的命令列程式",
    "Run a command in a terminal, then come back: magpie lists the agent here once it is installed. The npm commands need Node.js (nodejs.org).": "在終端機執行任一命令，安裝後會列在這裡。npm 命令需要 Node.js（nodejs.org）。",
    "Run a command in a terminal, then come back: magpie lists the agent here once it is installed.": "在終端機執行任一命令，安裝後會列在這裡。",
    "No Node.js was found here, so the npm commands install it with nvm first.": "本機未找到 Node.js，npm 命令會先用 nvm 安裝它。",
    "On a Mac, nvm needs Xcode's Command Line Tools: if it asks for them, run xcode-select --install, then the command again.": "Mac 上 nvm 需要 Xcode 命令列工具：如有提示，先執行 xcode-select --install，再重新執行命令。",
    "No Node.js was found here, so the npm commands install it with winget first; run them in PowerShell. If npm isn't found after Node.js is installed, open a new terminal and run the npm install again.": "本機未找到 Node.js，npm 命令會先用 winget 安裝它，請在 PowerShell 中執行。若裝好 Node.js 後仍找不到 npm，請開啟新終端機重新執行 npm 安裝。",
    "Node.js + npm": "Node.js + npm",
    "Installer": "安裝指令碼",
    "{agent}'s install command": "{agent} 的安裝命令",
