    "{model}, picked here, isn't set up any more: its provider was removed or turned off, or no longer has it. No other model sees, so images are turned away. Pick another model here.": "這裡選的 {model} 已無法使用：它的服務商被刪除或關閉了，或者不再提供這個模型。也沒有其他能看圖的模型，所以圖片會被拒收。請在這裡另選一個模型。",
