    "Cursor, Claude Desktop and other agents can add this search as an MCP server (Streamable HTTP), with a web_search tool and a web_fetch tool that reads a page by its URL. From another computer, send a gateway key as Authorization: Bearer <key>.": "Cursor、Claude Desktop 等智慧體可以把這個搜尋新增為 MCP 伺服器（Streamable HTTP），提供 web_search 工具和依 URL 讀取網頁的 web_fetch 工具。從其他電腦存取時，請以 Authorization: Bearer <key> 傳送閘道金鑰。",
