    "Agents can add image recognition as an MCP server (Streamable HTTP) with one analyze_image tool, which reads an image with the Image recognition model from a file path, a URL or a data URL. From another computer, send a gateway key as Authorization: Bearer <key> and the image as a URL or data URL.": "智慧體可以把識圖新增為 MCP 伺服器（Streamable HTTP），提供一個 analyze_image 工具：用識圖模型讀取檔案路徑、URL 或 data URL 中的圖片。從其他電腦存取時，請以 Authorization: Bearer <key> 傳送閘道金鑰，圖片以 URL 或 data URL 傳入。",
