    "When provider search is off, only configured Search APIs are used. Without a Search API, magpie does not add a search tool. Providers' native web search is unchanged.": "關閉供應商代搜後，僅使用已設定的搜尋 API；未設定時，Magpie 不新增搜尋工具。供應商內建的聯網搜尋不受影響。",
    "Provider search is off; only these APIs are used": "已關閉供應商代搜，僅使用這些 API",
    "Searches for other models": "代搜供應商",
    "When a model can't search the web directly, the selected provider searches for it and returns the results. Searches may use the service's quota or incur charges; if the provider magpie picks fails, it tries other available sources, but a provider you select here is never replaced by another provider, only by your Search APIs.": "當模型無法直接聯網搜尋時，由所選供應商代為搜尋並返回結果。代搜可能消耗所用服務的額度或產生費用；magpie 自動選擇的供應商失敗時會嘗試其他可用來源，但在此手動選中的供應商不會被換成其他供應商，只會改用你設定的搜尋 API。",
    "{who} didn't search {when}: {why}. No other provider searched in its place; pick Automatic or another provider, or add a Search API.": "{who} {when}沒能搜尋：{why}。沒有換用其他供應商代搜；可改選「自動」或其他供應商，或新增搜尋 API。",
