    "{field} — filter, or type any model id…": "{field} — 篩選，或輸入任意模型 ID…",
    "Filter {field}…": "篩選{field}…",
    "No matches.": "沒有匹配項。",
    "Qoder has no public API for this; magpie signs requests as its desktop client would, which Qoder may treat as third-party use and act on. Use an account you can afford to lose.": "Qoder 沒有公開 API；magpie 以其桌面用戶端的方式簽發請求，Qoder 可能視為第三方使用並採取措施。請用丟了也不心疼的帳號。",
    "Zed serves these models to its own editor; magpie signs requests as the editor would, which Zed may treat as third-party use and act on. Use an account you can afford to lose.": "Zed 只向自己的編輯器提供這些模型；magpie 以編輯器的方式簽發請求，Zed 可能視為第三方使用並採取措施。請用丟了也不心疼的帳號。",
    "Anthropic may suspend or ban a Claude account it sees used outside its own apps. magpie sends requests through Claude Code, but Anthropic may still act on them; you use it at your own risk. Use an account you can afford to lose.": "Anthropic 可能封禁在其官方應用之外使用的 Claude 帳號。magpie 的請求經 Claude Code 發出，但 Anthropic 仍可能採取措施，風險自負。請用丟了也不心疼的帳號。",
    "Factory serves these models to its own Droid CLI; magpie signs requests as Droid would, which Factory may treat as third-party use and act on. Use an account you can afford to lose.": "Factory 只向自己的 Droid CLI 提供這些模型；magpie 以 Droid 的方式簽發請求，Factory 可能視為第三方使用並採取措施。請用丟了也不心疼的帳號。",
    "A Go plan account is used through Command Code's private interface, which Command Code may treat as a breach of its terms and ban the account for. Pro, Max and the other plans use its Provider API. Use a Go account you can afford to lose.": "Go 套餐帳號經 Command Code 的私有介面使用，Command Code 可能視為違反條款並封禁該帳號。Pro、Max 等其他套餐走其 Provider API。請用丟了也不心疼的 Go 帳號。",
    "Xiaomi serves these models to its own MiMo app; magpie signs requests as the app would, which Xiaomi may treat as third-party use and act on. Use an account you can afford to lose.": "小米只向自己的 MiMo 應用提供這些模型；magpie 以該應用的方式簽發請求，小米可能視為第三方使用並採取措施。請用丟了也不心疼的帳號。",
