    "When {name} is out of quota, rate limited or down, a request goes to these instead, top first. It only happens before any of the reply is sent, and {name} then sits out a minute.": "{name} 額度用完、限流或不可用時，請求按從上到下的順序改發給這些模型。僅在回覆開始前切換，之後 {name} 暫停使用一分鐘。",
    "{agent} and the gateway use the one in use. Sessions already running keep theirs until restarted.": "{agent} 和閘道使用標記為「使用中」的帳號。已在執行的會話保持原帳號，重啟後切換。",
    "The gateway uses the first. Tick more and it moves on to the next when the one before it is out of quota. {agent} itself stays signed in as it is.": "閘道優先用第一個帳號；勾選多個時，前一個額度用完自動換下一個。{agent} 本身的登入不變。",
    "The gateway uses the first. Tick more and it moves on to the next when the one before it is out of quota.": "閘道優先用第一個帳號；勾選多個時，前一個額度用完自動換下一個。",
