    "every {name} account needs signing in again. Sign one in above, then move.": "所有 {name} 帳號都需要重新登入。先在上方登入一個，再遷移。",
    "every {name} account needs signing in again. Sign one in under Providers, then move.": "所有 {name} 帳號需重新登入。先在「供應商」中登入一個，再遷移。",
    "the plugin doesn't serve {models}. Untick them under Models, or keep the built-in.": "外掛不提供 {models}。可在「模型」裡取消勾選，或繼續使用內建。",
    "the plugin doesn't serve {models} for {user}, though the built-in does. Untick them under Models, or keep the built-in.": "外掛沒有為 {user} 提供 {models}（內建提供）。可在「模型」裡取消勾選，或繼續使用內建。",
