    "{name} now runs on its plugin — {accounts}, {models}. Its editor in Providers moves it back.": "{name} 已改由外掛執行：{accounts}，{models}。在「供應商」中編輯它即可改回。",
    "{n} account": "{n} 個帳號",
    "Deprecated": "已棄用",
    "Some subscriptions are reached in ways their vendors' terms may not allow. So that magpie itself isn't banned over them, subscription providers are being decoupled from magpie and run by community plugins instead.": "部分訂閱的接入方式可能違反廠商條款。為免 magpie 本體因此被封禁，訂閱供應商正逐步移出 magpie，改由社群外掛提供。",
    "These built-in subscriptions are deprecated: {names}": "以下內建訂閱已棄用：{names}",
    "{name}'s built-in subscription is deprecated": "{name} 的內建訂閱已棄用",
    "Moving keeps your accounts, models and agents as they are.": "遷移後，帳號、模型和 agent 的設定都保持不變。",
    "Review the move": "檢視遷移",
    "Review in Plugins": "前往外掛頁遷移",
    "Hide this until another deprecated subscription is signed in": "隱藏，直到又有已棄用的訂閱登入",
    "{names} can run on it again, with the same accounts.": "{names} 可以再次由它執行，帳號不變。",
    "Not now": "暫不",
    "{user} is signed out": "{user} 已退出登入",
    "Signed out": "已退出登入",
    "Move {name} here": "把 {name} 遷到這裡",
