    "OpenAI Responses API · Codex": "OpenAI Responses API · Codex",
    "Some relays give out a key per protocol. Set it here and the gateway sends each request to the key that fits: Claude models to the Anthropic key, GPT models to the OpenAI one.": "有的中轉站按協議發放不同金鑰。在此標明後，閘道按請求選用對應金鑰：Claude 模型走 Anthropic 金鑰，GPT 模型走 OpenAI 金鑰。",
    "Use this key too": "同時啟用這個金鑰",
