    "WorkBuddy AI (international)": "WorkBuddy 國際版 (WorkBuddy AI)",
    "Qoder (international)": "Qoder 國際版 (qoder.com)",
    "Sign in with ChatGPT: your plan on OpenAI's own API, with your agent's own instructions rather than Codex's.": "用 ChatGPT 登入（Sign in with ChatGPT）：透過 OpenAI 官方 API 使用你的套餐，用的是你 agent 自己的指令，而不是 Codex 的。",
    "For accounts on qoder.com, the international site.": "適用於 qoder.com（國際站）的帳號。",
    "For accounts on qoder.cn: signed in with an Alibaba Cloud account or a phone number.": "適用於 qoder.cn 的帳號：阿里雲帳號 / 手機號登入。",
    "Sign in to another {name} account": "換一個 {name} 帳號登入",
    "{agent} keeps one account; the gateway runs it for every request. Signing in to another replaces it.": "{agent} 只儲存一個帳號，閘道的所有請求都用它。登入其他帳號會替換它。",
    "{name} subscription": "{name} 訂閱",
    "Finish signing in to {name} in your browser": "請在瀏覽器中完成 {name} 登入",
    "{name} accounts can be suspended": "{name} 帳號可能被封禁",
    "Google may suspend an Antigravity account it sees used outside Antigravity. Use one you can afford to lose.": "Google 可能封禁在 Antigravity 之外使用的 Antigravity 帳號。請用丟了也不心疼的帳號。",
    "Sign in anyway": "仍然登入",
    "Where is your {name} account?": "你的 {name} 帳號在哪個站點？",
    "Sign in where your GLM Coding Plan was bought, a team's plan too: z.ai, or bigmodel.cn for 智谱.": "在購買 GLM Coding Plan 的站點登入，團隊套餐也一樣：z.ai，或智譜的 bigmodel.cn。",
    "BigModel (智谱)": "智譜 BigModel",
    "Installing {cli}…": "正在安裝 {cli}…",
    "{name} is used through its own CLI, which isn't on this computer yet. magpie is installing it with the official installer; the sign-in page opens as soon as it's done.": "{name} 需透過自身 CLI 使用，本機尚未安裝。正在用官方安裝指令碼安裝，完成後立即開啟登入頁。",
    "magpie opened the sign-in page. The account shows up here as soon as you're done.": "已開啟登入頁，完成後帳號會出現在這裡。",
    "Open again": "重新開啟",
    "Other ways to sign in…": "其他登入方式…",
