    "Sign-in link": "登入連結",
    "magpie couldn't open your browser: {error}. Open the sign-in link below in a browser yourself.": "magpie 無法開啟瀏覽器：{error}。請自行在瀏覽器中開啟下方的登入連結。",
    "Proxy: {proxy}": "代理：{proxy}",
    "The sign-in goes through this proxy, as the account's requests will. One picked here is kept as the account's.": "登入經由這個代理，與這個帳號之後的請求相同。在這裡選的代理會儲存為這個帳號的代理。",
