    "Open it in another browser or profile: copy it there": "要用其他瀏覽器或瀏覽器設定登入，複製此連結到那裡開啟",
    "If the page the browser ends on won't load (magpie runs on a server or in Docker), copy its whole address and paste it here.": "若瀏覽器最終停在打不開的頁面（magpie 執行在伺服器或 Docker 中），請複製其完整位址貼上到這裡。",
    "Windows keeps port {port}, where the sign-in comes back, for Hyper-V, WSL or Docker, so the page the browser ends on won't load. Copy its whole address and paste it here.": "Windows 為 Hyper-V、WSL 或 Docker 保留了登入回呼的連接埠 {port}，瀏覽器最終停在的頁面將無法開啟。請複製其完整位址貼上到這裡。",
    "Another program has port {port}, where the sign-in comes back, so the page the browser ends on won't finish the sign-in. Copy its whole address and paste it here.": "登入回呼的連接埠 {port} 被其他程式佔用，瀏覽器最終停在的頁面無法完成登入。請複製其完整位址貼上到這裡。",
    "Callback URL": "回呼 URL",
    "If the page can't reach magpie (it runs on a server or in Docker), make an API key on {name}'s keys page and paste it here.": "若頁面連不上 magpie（執行在伺服器或 Docker 中），請在 {name} 的金鑰頁建立 API 金鑰並貼上到這裡。",
