    "Bring in accounts from CLIProxyAPI's auth files or {own}": "匯入 CLIProxyAPI 的認證檔案或 {own} 裡的帳號",
    "Bring in accounts from Codex's auth.json, codexbar's config.json, or exports from Cockpit Tools, CLIProxyAPI or Sub2API": "匯入 Codex 的 auth.json、codexbar 的 config.json，或 Cockpit Tools、CLIProxyAPI、Sub2API 匯出的帳號",
    "Choose or paste one or more files: Codex's auth.json, codexbar's config.json (in ~/.codexbar), or an export from Cockpit Tools, CLIProxyAPI or Sub2API. Each account's sign-in is refreshed with ChatGPT before it is added.": "選擇或貼上一個或多個檔案：Codex 的 auth.json、codexbar 的 config.json（位於 ~/.codexbar），或 Cockpit Tools、CLIProxyAPI、Sub2API 的匯出檔案。每個帳號先向 ChatGPT 重新整理登入再新增。",
    "This takes the sign-in over: the tool the file came from (Codex on another computer, codexbar, Cockpit Tools, CLIProxyAPI) is signed out of that account and has to sign in again. The file itself is only read.": "匯入會接管這個登入：檔案原本所在的工具（另一台電腦上的 Codex、codexbar、Cockpit Tools、CLIProxyAPI）會登出該帳號，需要重新登入。檔案本身只會讀取，不會變更。",
    "Choose or paste CLIProxyAPI's auth files (JSON) or {own}. Each account is kept as the file has it.": "選擇或貼上 CLIProxyAPI 的認證檔案（JSON）或 {own}。每個帳號依檔案原樣儲存。",
    "Claude Code renews the sign-in the first time it uses it, and the file's copy then stops working: the tool it came from has to sign in again.": "Claude Code 第一次使用時會續期這個登入，之後檔案裡的那份就失效了：原工具需要重新登入。",
    "Adding the accounts…": "正在新增帳號…",
    "Each account is kept as the file has it; nothing is asked of Claude.": "每個帳號依檔案原樣儲存，不會向 Claude 發出任何請求。",
    "The pasted text": "貼上的內容",
    "Checking the accounts with {vendor}…": "正在向 {vendor} 驗證帳號…",
    "Import from a file instead…": "改為從檔案匯入…",
    "Each account's sign-in is refreshed and its account looked up, as signing in does.": "像登入時一樣，重新整理每個帳號的登入並查詢帳號資訊。",
    "Each account's sign-in is refreshed and its project looked up, as signing in does.": "與登入時一樣，重新整理每個帳號的登入憑據並查詢它的專案。",
