    "{user} removed": "已移除 {user}",
    "magpie forgets this account's sign-in; the account itself is untouched": "magpie 移除這個帳號的登入資訊；帳號本身不受影響",
    "magpie stops showing and using {agent}'s own sign-in; its files are left as they are, and it shows again when {agent} signs in anew": "不再顯示和使用 {agent} 自己的登入；檔案保持原樣，{agent} 重新登入後再次出現",
    "Sign {agent} in to this account": "讓 {agent} 登入到這個帳號",
    "{agent} is now signed in as {user}": "{agent} 已切換為 {user}",
    "Codex's background service is still signed in as {user}": "Codex 的後臺服務仍登入著 {user}",
    "The Codex app is still signed in as {user}": "Codex 應用仍登入著 {user}",
    "It shows that account's usage limits until it is quit and opened again. Quit it and open it again to use the new account.": "在結束並重新開啟之前，它顯示的一直是該帳號的用量限額。結束後重新開啟即可使用新帳號。",
    "Restart it to use the new account. Running Codex sessions will be interrupted.": "重啟後才會使用新帳號，正在執行的 Codex 會話將中斷。",
    "Restart Zed if it still asks for an API key: magpie has configured its gateway credential in the system credential store.": "若 Zed 仍要求輸入 API 金鑰，請重啟 Zed：閘道憑據已寫入系統憑據儲存。",
    "In Air, start a new task and pick Magpie in its agent menu: magpie's models and routing groups are in its model menu.": "在 Air 中新增任務並在智慧體選單選 Magpie：模型選單中即有 magpie 的模型和路由組。",
    "Air runs magpie's models through OpenCode's ACP server, and OpenCode isn't installed here: install OpenCode (npm i -g opencode-ai), then pick Magpie in a new Air task.": "Air 經 OpenCode 的 ACP 服務使用 magpie 的模型，本機未安裝 OpenCode：請先安裝（npm i -g opencode-ai），再在 Air 新任務中選 Magpie。",
    "magpie's models are in VS Code's Chat model picker, under magpie (VS Code 1.122 or later). If they don't show, run Developer: Reload Window in VS Code.": "magpie 的模型位於 VS Code 聊天模型選擇器的 magpie 分組下（需 VS Code 1.122 或更高）。若未出現，請在 VS Code 中執行 Developer: Reload Window。",
