    "The library checks skills for updates with it: GitHub allows 5,000 requests an hour with a token, 60 without. It also installs skills from private repositories it can read; for public ones it needs no scopes.": "資源庫檢查技能更新時使用。GitHub 每小時允許帶令牌 5000 次請求，不帶僅 60 次。也用它從它能讀取的私有倉庫安裝技能；公開倉庫無需勾選許可權。",
    "Using {env} from the environment ({mask}); a token set here comes first.": "正在使用環境變數 {env}（{mask}）；在這裡設定的令牌優先。",
    "a GitHub token is one word, without spaces": "GitHub 令牌是一串不含空格的字元",
    "GitHub's rate limit for your GitHub token is used up until {time}": "你的 GitHub 令牌的請求額度已用完，{time} 恢復",
    "GitHub's rate limit for your GitHub token is used up for now": "你的 GitHub 令牌的請求額度暫時用完了",
    "GitHub allows 60 requests an hour without a token, used up until {time}. Add a GitHub token in Settings → Network and sharing to raise it to 5,000.": "GitHub 不帶令牌每小時僅允許 60 次請求，已用完，{time} 恢復。在 設定 → 網路與共享 新增 GitHub 令牌可提高到 5000 次。",
    "GitHub allows 60 requests an hour without a token, used up for now. Add a GitHub token in Settings → Network and sharing to raise it to 5,000.": "GitHub 不帶令牌每小時僅允許 60 次請求，暫時已用完。在 設定 → 網路與共享 新增 GitHub 令牌可提高到 5000 次。",
    "GitHub refused the GitHub token in Settings → Network and sharing: it may have expired or been revoked": "GitHub 拒絕了 設定 → 網路與共享 中的 GitHub 令牌：它可能已過期或被復原",
