    "Starting the gateway…": "正在啟動閘道…",
    "Port {port} is held by {path} (pid {pid}), which isn't magpie, so magpie leaves it alone. Quit it yourself, or move the gateway to another port in Settings.": "連接埠 {port} 被 {path}（pid {pid}）佔用，它不是 magpie，所以 magpie 不會動它。請自行退出它，或在設定裡把閘道換到其他連接埠。",
    "Port {port} is forwarded by {path} (pid {pid}) to a container or a VM: the magpie {v} answering there runs inside it, out of this magpie's reach. Stop that container (docker ps lists it, docker stop <name> stops it, or stop it in OrbStack or Docker Desktop), or move this magpie's gateway to another port in Settings.": "連接埠 {port} 由 {path}（pid {pid}）轉發到一個容器或虛擬機器：在那裡應答的 magpie {v} 執行在容器裡，這個 magpie 管不到它。請停掉那個容器（docker ps 可以列出它，docker stop <名稱> 停掉它，或在 OrbStack、Docker Desktop 裡停止），或在設定裡把這個 magpie 的閘道換到其他連接埠。",
    "magpie can't see which process holds port {port}: it runs as another user or as administrator. Quit it there.": "magpie 看不到是哪個程序佔用了連接埠 {port}：它以其他使用者或管理員身份執行。請在那邊退出它。",
    "magpie {v} (pid {pid}, {path}) runs as another user or as administrator, so this magpie can't quit it. Quit it there.": "magpie {v}（pid {pid}，{path}）以其他使用者或管理員身份執行，目前 magpie 無法關閉它。請在那邊退出它。",
    "magpie {v} (pid {pid}) didn't quit. End it in your system's process list (Activity Monitor, Task Manager).": "magpie {v}（pid {pid}）沒有退出。請在系統的程序列表（活動監視器、工作管理員）裡結束它。",
    "Something started magpie on port {port} again at once ({path}, pid {pid}): a login item or a service keeps it running (a LaunchAgent, a systemd unit, a scheduled task). Remove that, then try again.": "連接埠 {port} 上的 magpie 被立即重新啟動了（{path}，pid {pid}）：有登入項或系統服務讓它一直執行（LaunchAgent、systemd 單元、計劃任務）。請先移除它，再重試。",
    "Port {port} is in use by {path} (pid {pid}): quit it, or move the gateway to another port in Settings.": "連接埠 {port} 被 {path}（pid {pid}）佔用：請退出它，或在設定裡把閘道換到其他連接埠。",
    "Port {port} is in use by another program: quit it, or move the gateway to another port in Settings.": "連接埠 {port} 被其他程式佔用：請退出它，或在設定裡把閘道換到其他連接埠。",
    "magpie {v} serves the gateway, and it isn't older than this one: quit it there to serve the gateway here.": "閘道由 magpie {v} 提供，它不比目前版本舊：請在那邊退出它，再由這裡提供閘道。",
