    "The `magpie` command at {path} is a copied file, not the installer's link to the app: it won't follow the app's updates, and an old copy can break what a new one fixed. Re-run the installer, or link it by hand.": "`magpie` 命令（{path}）是複製的檔案，不是安裝指令碼建立的應用連結：不會隨應用更新，舊複製可能使新版的修復失效。請重新執行安裝指令碼，或手動建立連結。",
