    "{n} requests in this period were magpie's own": "此期間有 {n} 個請求是 magpie 自身發出的",
    "Requests magpie made by itself, not an agent: a routing group's classifier, a web search or an image description. They count against the key or account like any other request.": "magpie 自身發出的請求，而非代理發出的：路由群組的分類器、網頁搜尋或圖片描述。它們與其他請求一樣計入金鑰或帳號的用量。",
