    "At its cap": "已達上限",
    "At its cap · back {in}": "已達上限 · {in}恢復",
    "A usage window is at {n}%, past this account's {cap}% cap, so magpie counts it as used up and sends requests to the other accounts until that window renews": "某個用量時段已用 {n}%，超過該帳號的 {cap}% 上限，時段重置前視為已用完，請求發給其他帳號",
    "With no other account on, requests are refused with a usage-cap error until then": "沒有其他啟用的帳號時，在此之前請求會返回「已達用量上限」的錯誤",
    "At its cap · {agent} still uses it": "已達上限 · {agent} 仍在使用",
    "A usage window is at {n}%, past this account's {cap}% cap: requests through magpie are refused with a usage-cap error until it renews": "某個用量時段已用 {n}%，超過該帳號的 {cap}% 上限：時段重置前，經 magpie 的請求會返回「已達用量上限」錯誤",
    "{agent} is signed in to this account and asks its vendor itself, not through magpie, so with no other account on to move it to, {agent} goes on using it past the cap. Add another account, or pick {agent}'s models via magpie, for the cap to hold it": "{agent} 登入此帳號並直接向廠商發請求，不經過 magpie；沒有其他啟用帳號可切換時，{agent} 會超過上限繼續使用。新增其他帳號，或為 {agent} 選擇經 magpie 的模型，上限才能生效",
    "{names} at its cap": "{names}已達上限",
    "{names} at its cap · back {in}": "{names}已達上限 · {in}恢復",
    "{names} is at {n}%, past this account's {cap}% cap, so magpie sends the requests it counts to the other accounts until it renews; other models still use this account": "{names}已用 {n}%，超過該帳號的 {cap}% 上限，重置前計入它的請求發給其他帳號；其他模型仍用此帳號",
    "With no other account on, those requests are refused with a usage-cap error until then": "沒有其他啟用的帳號時，在此之前這些請求會返回「已達用量上限」的錯誤",
    "Stops at {n}% of each usage window: once magpie reads a window at {n}% or past it, it counts this account as used up and sends it nothing more until the window renews. A turn already under way can still take it past {n}%, so the cap doesn't promise the rest is left. Click to change": "每個用量時段用到 {n}% 即停：magpie 讀到某個時段達到 {n}% 或更高後，就把該帳號視為已用完，在時段重置前不再傳送請求給它。已在進行中的請求仍可能讓它超過 {n}%，所以上限不保證剩下的額度不被用掉。點選修改",
    "Used to 100% of its usage windows. Click to cap it at a share of each, so magpie goes on to the other accounts past it": "用量時段會用到 100%。點選設定比例上限，超過後改用其他帳號",
    "{who} stops at {n}% of each window": "{who} 每個時段用到 {n}% 即停",
    "No cap on {window}: it is used to 100%, whatever this account's cap. Click to change": "{window}不設上限：無論此帳號的上限是多少，都用到 100%。點擊修改",
    "{window} has a cap of its own: magpie counts this account as used up once {window} is at {n}%, until it renews. Click to change": "{window}有自己的上限：{window}用到 {n}% 時，magpie 就把此帳號視為用完，直到它重置。點擊修改",
    "Click to give {window} a cap of its own, apart from this account's": "點擊為{window}單獨設一個上限，與此帳號的上限分開",
    "{window} of {who} follows the account's cap": "{who} 的{window}改為沿用帳號上限",
