    "Key header": "金鑰標頭",
    "Which header the API key goes in on the Anthropic API. Most services take both; pick one for a service that refuses the two together. magpie also switches to one by itself when a service says so.": "Anthropic API 的 API 金鑰放在哪個標頭裡。多數服務兩個都接受；有的服務不允許兩個同時出現，就選其中一個。服務這樣提示時，magpie 也會自己改成只送一個。",
