    "Don't check its certificate": "不驗證它的憑證",
    "Certificate": "憑證",
    "For your own server with a self-signed certificate or one from your company's CA. magpie then can't tell it from another machine answering at its address: turn it on only on a network you trust.": "用於你自己的伺服器，憑證是自簽的或來自公司內部 CA。開啟後 magpie 無法分辨應答的是它本身還是同一位址上的另一台機器：只在你信任的網路中開啟。",
    "Codex compacts on this provider": "Codex 在此服務商上原生壓縮",
    "Codex's compaction is asked of this provider as Codex sent it, and the summary it seals goes back to Codex unchanged. Off, magpie writes the summary. A conversation compacted this way continues only on this provider and account: another is refused with an error, never sent without the context.": "Codex 的壓縮請求原樣交給此服務商，它加密的摘要原樣還給 Codex。關閉時由 magpie 寫摘要。這樣壓縮過的對話只能在此服務商和帳號上繼續：換到別處會報錯說明，絕不丟掉上下文送出。",
    "For a model running on this computer or your local network: secrets, personal data and your masked words go to it as written. Leave it off for a local relay or proxy that passes requests on to a vendor.": "給執行在這臺電腦或區域網裡的模型：金鑰、個人資訊和你設的脫敏詞按原樣發給它。如果它是本地的中轉或代理、會把請求轉給供應商，請保持關閉。",
    "User-Agent": "User-Agent",
    "Send the agent's own User-Agent": "傳送 Agent 自己的 User-Agent",
    "For a plan that serves only the coding agents it names: each request goes with the User-Agent the agent sent (pi, OpenCode, Claude Code…), not magpie's. Requests magpie makes itself, and ones the agent sent without one, still go as magpie. A User-Agent set in Headers above always wins.": "給只允許指定程式設計 Agent 使用的方案：每個請求帶上 Agent 自己送來的 User-Agent（pi、OpenCode、Claude Code…），而不是 magpie 的。magpie 自己發出的請求，以及 Agent 沒帶 User-Agent 的請求，仍以 magpie 的身分傳送。上面請求頭裡設定的 User-Agent 永遠優先。",
    "DeepSeek models only from DeepSeek's own API": "DeepSeek 模型只走 DeepSeek 官方上游",
    "Upstream": "上游",
    "Cline serves a model from any host its gateway picks; pinned, a request for a DeepSeek model goes only to DeepSeek, which keeps its prompt cache, and fails when DeepSeek can't take it": "Cline 的閘道會把一個模型發給它挑的任意上游；釘住後，DeepSeek 模型的請求只發給 DeepSeek 官方，快取能命中；DeepSeek 官方接不了時請求會失敗，不會換別家",
    "For a relay in front of Anthropic's or OpenAI's own API: Claude Code's WebSearch and Codex's web_search go to it as they were sent, not through magpie's search. magpie doesn't automatically search with it for other models, but you can name it as the searcher.": "用於 Anthropic 或 OpenAI 官方 API 前的中轉：Claude Code 的 WebSearch 和 Codex 的 web_search 原樣發給它，不經 magpie 搜尋。不會自動用它為其他模型搜尋，但可手動選為代搜供應商。",
    "Its models leave the list agents pick from; the routing groups they are in still use them": "它的模型不出現在 Agent 的可選列表裡；所在的路由分組仍會使用它們",
    "Agents don't see them: only the routing groups they are in use them.": "Agent 看不到這些模型，只有它們所在的路由分組會用到。",
    "Agents see the models picked.": "Agent 看到的是已勾選的模型。",
    "In no routing group, so no agent can use them now: {models}.": "不在任何路由分組中，暫無 Agent 能用：{models}。",
    "Once saved, make a group of them in Routing.": "儲存後可在「路由」裡為它們建分組。",
