    "{provider} is used only through routing groups, and {model} is in none, so no agent can use it. Make a group of it, or untick “Only through routing groups” in {provider}'s models.": "{provider} 設為只透過路由分組使用，而 {model} 不在任何分組中，沒有 Agent 能用它。可為它建分組，或在 {provider} 的模型中取消勾選「只透過路由分組使用」。",
    "None selected: no agent or routing group uses its models. Its balance and usage still show. Click a model to pick it.": "全不選：Agent 和路由分組都不使用它的模型，餘額和用量照常顯示。點選模型可勾選。",
