    "Up-to-date documentation and code examples for any library, straight into the prompt.": "任意庫的最新文件與程式碼範例，直接送進提示詞。",
    "Drive a real browser: open pages, click, type and read them through the accessibility tree.": "驅動真實瀏覽器：開啟頁面、點選、輸入，並透過無障礙樹讀取頁面。",
