    "Open {name} in Providers": "在供應商中開啟 {name}",
    "Installed": "已安裝",
    "magpie community": "magpie 社群",
    "Written for magpie by its community, in github.com/magpie-community/plugins": "由 magpie 社群編寫，原始碼在 github.com/magpie-community/plugins",
    "{n}/week": "{n}/週",
