    "Filter {n} keys — name, key, off, resting…": "{n} Schlüssel filtern — Name, Schlüssel, aus, pausiert…",
    "{n} of {m} keys": "{n} von {m} Schlüsseln",
    "Show fewer": "Weniger anzeigen",
    "Hide {n}, of every provider? Click again": "{n} ausblenden, aller Anbieter? Nochmal klicken",
    "Show {n} hidden, of every provider? Click again": "{n} ausgeblendete aller Anbieter anzeigen? Nochmal klicken",
    "{n} keys removed": "{n} Schlüssel entfernt",
