    "Gemini compatible": "Gemini-kompatibel",
    "…/v1beta — Google's Gemini API (generateContent), or one that answers as it does; the key goes in x-goog-api-key": "…/v1beta — Googles Gemini API (generateContent) oder eine, die genauso antwortet; der Schlüssel geht in x-goog-api-key",
